"Only WeChat Official Account article links from https://mp.weixin.qq.com/ "
"are supported."

#: wechat-article-importer.php:384 wechat-article-importer.php:528
msgid ""
"Could not parse the article content. The link may be invalid or the WeChat "
"page structure may have changed."
msgstr ""
"Could not parse the article content. The link may be invalid or the WeChat "
"page structure may have changed."

#: wechat-article-importer.php:404
msgid "Article parsed successfully. Preparing to download images..."
msgstr "Article parsed successfully. Preparing to download images..."

